110
00:09:58,920 --> 00:09:59,920
Emportez ça sans traîner.

111
00:10:00,920 --> 00:10:01,920
Euh, tout de suite.

112
00:10:01,920 --> 00:10:05,920
Oh, quel soulagement !

113
